OL,3,AThe artist dropping her debut album
OL,4,Aafter a billion streams
OL,5,
OL,6,FReleasing your first album is a big
OL,7,Fstep for any artist, but for Jazzy it's
OL,8,Fone that's followed some huge strides.
OL,10,FThe Irish singer and DJ has been
OL,11,Fstreamed more than a billion times and
OL,12,Fworked with industry heavyweights
OL,13,Fincluding Calvin Harris.
OL,15,FIf that's not enough, on Saturday she
OL,16,Fhas her biggest gig yet when she'll be
OL,17,Fplaying tracks like No Bad Vibes and
OL,18,FSomeday in front of a home crowd in
OL,19,FDublin.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
