OL,3,AThe artist dropping her debut album
OL,4,Aafter a billion streams
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor Jazzy, writing an album has always
OL,7,Fbeen in the back of her mind and now,
OL,8,Ffinally, it's time to hit send.
